course: dictionary
lesson: 1235
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 1
explain: One word can have more than one meaning, and the words around it tell you which meaning the writer means. Take bum. «"pìgu" means bottom or bum; it is a childish word, not a rude one.» Here the clue is childish, so bum means bottom.
explain: In US slang, bum can mean a homeless person or someone who will not work, and it can be unkind. So the same word can be silly in one place and hurtful in another. Ask yourself who is speaking, and what the other words in the sentence are doing.
explain: Bum also comes in phrases. To bum a ride means to ask for one for free, a bum deal is a poor deal, and to bum around means to do very little. When a word has several meanings, try each one in the sentence and keep the one that makes sense.
fact: «Bum» can mean your bottom, and in UK and Australian homes it is a mild, childish word.
fact: In US slang, «bum» can mean a homeless person or someone who will not work, and it can be unkind.
fact: To bum something means to ask for it for free, as in «bum a ride».
fact: A «bum deal» is a poor or unfair deal, and a «beach bum» is a person who spends all their time on a hobby, such as the beach.
exercise: «"pìgu" means bottom or bum; it is a childish word, not a rude one.» What kind of word is bum in this sentence? | A rude word for an insult | A word for a homeless person | A word for a fast car | *A childish word for bottom
exercise: Maya says, «He wants to bum a ride home.» What does bum mean here? | *To ask for a ride for free | To sit on the bench | To pay for a taxi with coins | To break the car
exercise: «It was a bum deal, and nobody was happy.» What does bum mean? | Very fast | *Poor or bad quality | Brand new | Happy and kind
test: Which phrase means a person who spends all their time on a hobby? | *beach bum | bum a lift | bum deal | bum around
test: Why should you be careful with bum in US slang? | Because it means something very polite | Because it is a number | *Because it can be an unkind word for a homeless or lazy person | Because it only ever means bottom
exam: Ella reads, «The bum knee stopped him from running.» What does bum mean? | Lazy and homeless | *Bad or poor quality | Asking for something for free | Bottom
